      "message": "This will not do snapshot-merge post update. Snapshot-merge will only happen when there is a slot switch.\n\nIf the goal here is to boot without slot switch then you could try:\n\n$snapshotctl map-snapshots\n\nPlease see the relevant code here:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/core/fs_mgr/libsnapshot/snapshotctl.cpp;l\u003d1109\n\nThis will boot the device off the snapshots (i.e target build) and then you could revert back to older build.\n\nThere is also a thin shell script wrapper which might be helpful.\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/core/fs_mgr/libsnapshot/scripts/apply-update.sh;l\u003d102",
